<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title><%= dan %>단</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/">소개</a> |
    <a href="/foods">좋아하는 음식</a> |
    <a href="/timetable">수업 시간표</a>
    | <a href="/gugudan_2">구구단</a>
  </nav>

  <h2><%= dan %>단</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <% for (let i = 1; i <= 9; i++) { %>
      <p><%= dan %> x <%= i %> = <%= dan * i %></p>
    <% } %>
  </div>

  <div class="card center">
    <p>주소 끝의 숫자를 바꾸면 단이 바뀝니다.</p>
    <p>/gugudan_2 → 2단</p>
    <p>/gugudan_5 → 5단</p>
    <p>/gugudan_9 → 9단</p>
    <p>지금 주소: /gugudan_<%= dan %></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
